        "official_en_sha256": "5cc5450fb753d2e96eb14ac728d83a4e211a81afc33e04ace46fbd77110cc81f"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ええ、もうプリプリ肉はうんざり。\r\nおかげで、プリプリ肉屋は\r\n儲かってるようだけど……",
        "official_en": "That’s right, we’re sick and tired of eating Mushy Meat. The guy selling it’s making a killing though, that’s for sure.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
